xt":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileDialogMessage(_:)-9pb68":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/filedialogmessage(_:)-9pb68","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileDialogMessage(_:)-9pb68","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fileDialogMessage"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"title":"fileDialogMessage(_:)","role":"symbol"}}}